#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:5
#: 5bafe63f4b64431eb634a68b9a5a7eae
msgid "LeddarTech LeddarVu8"
msgstr "LeddarTech LeddarVu8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:7
#: 40e31240d2794465a1b447c42386b149
msgid ""
"The `LeddarTech LeddarVu8 <https://leddartech.com/lidar/leddar-vu8-solid-"
"state-lidar-sensor-module/>`__ is a long range (185m) lidar which provides 8"
" individual distances within a 16deg to 99deg field of view depending upon "
"the model used.  ArduPilot always uses the shortest of the 8 distances "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"`LeddarTech LeddarVu8 <https://leddartech.com/lidar/leddar-vu8-solid-state-"
"lidar-sensor-module/>`__ 是一款远程（185m）激光雷达，根据使用的型号，在 16 度到 99 度的视野范围内提供 8 "
"个独立距离值。ArduPilot 始终使用这 8 个距离中最短的一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:14
#: 50db419f244a4da686b6d0017c829146
msgid "Support for this sensor was released with Copter-4.0.4"
msgstr "对该传感器的支持从 Copter-4.0.4 开始发布"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:17
#: 24f77b13773f438c86a29bde9928605a
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:19
#: 750c6ff489a643bba0aff5811cf0a385
msgid ""
"Any of the autopilot's spare serial ports may be used.  The diagram below "
"shows how to connect the sensor's TX, RX and GND pins assuming Serial2 is "
"used."
msgstr "可使用飞控上任何空闲的串口。下图显示了假设使用 Serial2 时，如何连接传感器的 TX、RX 和 GND 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:23
#: 134d820f40d84713bf5ad192ec4a2b74
msgid ""
"The lidar must be powered separately with a stable 12V source.  During "
"testing the lidar was unable to reliably provide distances if the voltage "
"dropped below 11V."
msgstr "激光雷达必须单独使用稳定的 12V 电源供电。测试中发现，当电压低于 11V 时，激光雷达无法可靠提供距离数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:25
#: 176ac2711bde4d50bba74b9254ef4cc8
msgid "The following parameters should be set"
msgstr "应设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:27
#: ff0a2c882fc14c8f8298fb22dc2e510f
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:28
#: bc27214794fa463bbf4f10f13de14810
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:29
#: 5840b0bcd351486b85c8086237cf1713
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 29 (LeddarVu8-Serial)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 29（LeddarVu8-Serial）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:30
#: e0e393b11fea4cf2a7be7487d45b0f75
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.15"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.15"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:31
#: 57f070c111ad424c82946cd05127617c
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 160.  *This is the distance in meters "
"that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 160。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:32
#: 6526cd20a0624eda8a3cc7d8bacabd15
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更精确地，飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:34
#: 0b209ffc42504122bfdf1c9f46801a02
msgid ""
"If you instead were using the Serial4 port on the autopilot then you would "
"set :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9, and :ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD "
"<SERIAL4_BAUD>` to 115"
msgstr ""
"如果改用飞控的 Serial4 端口，则应设置 :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9，以及 "
":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` 为 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:37
#: b69ebf16a7cb4135881f16b459511d02
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:39
#: 06edecd0b613482893fceeb31071e861
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
